tasks.description:
创建 Task 模型用于存储任务信息。需要在 app/models/ 目录下创建 task.py，包含字段: id, title, description, status, created_at。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /tasks (request: {title: str, description: str, status: str}) -> {id, title, description, status, created_at}
- GET /tasks -> [{id, title, description, status, created_at}]
- PUT /tasks/{id} (request: {title: str, description: str, status: str}) -> {id, title, description, status, created_at}
- DELETE /tasks/{id} -> {message: str}

